<h3><u>Abad hui karbobala ujda madina</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)<br />
Zainab ko narasaya muharram ka mahina<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>1. Ek din tha, ke is-e shehr-e ki karti thi me shahi (Or aaj tabahi) x2<br />
Be ghusl-e pada mohr-e nabuwat-e ka nagina. Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>2. Kis laash pe rouu kis chhodu me baraadar (Lash-e he bahattar) x2<br />
Had ye he ke rone ki ijazat-e bhi mili na.Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>3. Asghar ka gala bhayi ka sar, sinaye akbar (Sab goharo chadar) x2<br />
Is dasht me luta gaya zainab ka khazina. Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>4. Maye binaa pehchan saki, bacho ke chehre (Bikhre huwe sehre) x2<br />
Hai khun ke darya me gharibo ka safina. Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>5. Ek aag hai, khaymo me kayamat ka samaa hai (Ghazi tu kaha hai) x2<br />
Dekho to ridaa cheen liya, shimr kamina. Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>6. Chadar chini, dur lay liye ab zulmana dhaao (Baba se milaao) x2<br />
Neze ke tale baith ke roti hai sakina.Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>

<p>7. Paband-e rasan bibiya bazar khule sar (Har mod pe pathar) x2<br />
Masum yatimo ka baha surkh pasina. Barbad huwi mai<br />
Abad huwi karbobala, ujda madina. Barbad huwi mai..(2)</p>
</p>